    "narrative": "As we navigate the final stretch of the 2026 campaign, the schedule today is sparse, forcing us into a highly selective approach to preserve our remaining game caps. Our primary focal point is **Jonathan Aranda**, who holds an efficiency score of 49.13. While Misiorowski presents a significant challenge with an xERA of 2.35, **Jonathan Aranda** remains a marginal start due to his projected slot in the #2 hole and a favorable platoon dynamic against the right-hander. While he doesn't reach the \"Strong\" threshold, his role at the top of the order provides the best path to value among our active roster tonight.\n\nWith the majority of our heavy hitters\u2014including **Jos\u00e9 Ram\u00edrez**, **Bryce Harper**, **Cal Raleigh**, and **Lawrence Butler**\u2014all sidelined by a team off-day, our options are limited. The bench remains quiet, and there were no difficult choices between starters and non-starters today, as the lack of games effectively streamlined our decision-making process. We are prioritizing the preservation of our caps for tomorrow\u2019s slate, where we expect **Yainer Diaz**, **Justin Crawford**, **Tyler Freeman**, **Will Smith**, **Matt Chapman**, and **Daulton Varsho** to return to action. We will also monitor **Luis Arraez**, **Dylan Beavers**, **Masyn Winn**, **JJ Bleday**, **Jeremiah Jackson**, **Brendan Donovan**, **Jung Hoo Lee**, **Zack Gelof**, **Gleyber Torres**, **Gavin Sheets**, **Alex Freeland**, **Kyle Karros**, and **Braden Montgomery** closely, as their sprint speed and versatility remain vital for closing the gap in stolen bases.\n\nCaution is advised regarding the \"Lineup Pending\" status for **Jonathan Aranda**; should he drop out of the #2 spot, his efficiency score will likely dip below the floor, at which point we will pivot to a full bench to protect our cap reserves. We are operating in a low-volume environment today, but our commitment to the SB-centric strategy remains absolute\u2014we are holding our high-speed assets for matchups where the park and platoon advantages align more favorably than they do against this current elite pitching opposition.",
